tests/ui/types/err_scalar_plus_vector.sky:7:7: error: cannot add a scalar to a vector
  |
7 | w = v + 2
  |       ^ no broadcasting between a scalar and an array
  |     - this is Vector[3] [1]
  |         - this is Scalar [1]
  = help: write `v + 2 * ones(v)` for every element

tests/ui/types/err_scalar_plus_vector.sky:9:12: error: cannot add a vector to a scalar
  |
9 | x = energy + p
  |            ^ no broadcasting between a scalar and an array
  |     ------ this is Scalar [L²·M·T⁻²]
  |              - this is Vector[3] [L·M·T⁻¹]
  = note: the dimensions differ as well: energy and L·M·T⁻¹

tests/ui/types/err_scalar_plus_vector.sky:10:7: error: cannot subtract a scalar from a matrix
   |
10 | y = M - 2
   |       ^ no broadcasting between a scalar and an array
   |     - this is Matrix[3,4] [1]
   |         - this is Scalar [1]
   = help: write `M - 2 * ones(M)` for every element

tests/ui/types/err_scalar_plus_vector.sky:11:7: error: cannot add a matrix to a scalar
   |
11 | z = 2 + S
   |       ^ no broadcasting between a scalar and an array
   |     - this is Scalar [1]
   |         - this is Matrix[N,N] [1]
   = help: write `2 * ones(S) + S` for every element, or `identity(n) + S` for the identity

tests/ui/types/err_scalar_plus_vector.sky:12:7: error: cannot subtract a scalar from a vector
   |
12 | t = v - (1 + 2)
   |       ^ no broadcasting between a scalar and an array
   |     - this is Vector[3] [1]
   |         ------- this is Scalar [1]
   = help: write `v - (1 + 2) * ones(v)` for every element
